stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> awaiting_payment: Online placement and stock hold
    [*] --> pending: COD placement and stock allocation
    awaiting_payment --> pending: Verified capture and active hold, allocate
    awaiting_payment --> expired: Timeout wins lock, release hold
    awaiting_payment --> cancelled: Cancellation wins lock, release hold
    pending --> processing: Authorized fulfillment command
    pending --> cancelled: Eligible cancellation, release allocation
    processing --> cancelled: Staff cancellation before shipping, release
    processing --> shipped: Commit shipment and consume stock
    shipped --> delivered: Trusted delivery evidence
    delivered --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
    note right of pending
        COD may remain unpaid.
        Online order has verified settlement.
    end note
    note right of delivered
        Returns and refunds have separate states.
        COD collection is a separate fact.
    end note
    note left of expired
        Late capture creates a payment exception
        and refund task, it does not revive order.
    end note
